<title>USA: Sioux Falls feeder cattle not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls feeder cattle not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Not enough feeder steers or heifers were on hand to test a trend, few steady, USDA said.  About 88 percent were over 600 lbs.</p>
<p>Steers: Medium and Large 1: 650-700 lbs 91.00-95.25; part load 1027 lbs 72.10; load 1089 lbs fleshy 70.70.</p>
<p>Heifers: Medium and Large 1: load 966 lbs fleshy gaunt Limo-cross 69.30.</p>
<p>Receipts: This Week 264  Last Week 337  Last Year 1,554.</p>
